  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Health Organization (WHO) Framework Convention on Tobacco Control 2030 (FCTC 2030) - Secondee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an Official Development Assistance (ODA) funded UKaid project from the Department of Health and Social Care (DHSC) funding the secondment of a DHSC tobacco expert to lead the Framework Convention on Tobacco Control 2030 (FCTC2030) project. This work promotes the implementation of the FCTC in low- and middle-income countries in order to reduce tobacco consumption and support the development of ODA-recipient countries.</narrative>
  </description>
